/T (Of course, this is not to say that there is no scope for more informal arrangements to also be relevant in this issue area, as is the case in international security or international migration. Rather, global health operations that rely more on informal mechanisms tend not to witness major involvement by countries, as opposed to philanthropic foundations or non-governmental organizations. )
