/P 142 0 R
/T (In sum, the EU can do more in global health governance than provide funding. It has an opportunity to be more assertive in providing policy direction based on a clearer internal sense of purpose that has more ambition than Team Europe. Through better internal coordination, dedicated financing, and deepening strategic partnerships, the EU can position itself as a key architect of a more stable and equitable global health governance system. )
/E (In sum, the EU can do more in global health governance than provide funding. It has an opportunity to be more assertive in providing policy direction based on a clearer internal sense of purpose that has more ambition than Team Europe. Through better internal coordination, dedicated financing, and deepening strategic partnerships, the EU can position itself as a key architect of a more stable and equitable global health governance system. )
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [4 5]
